  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWhen using `WorkletGlobalScope`, not having `TextEncoder` and `TextDecoder` is currently inhibiting WebAssembly use cases that rely on using these primitives to encode and decode strings from and to Wasm.\n\nHas there been any previous discussion around exposing these? It could be a very useful improvement for WebAssembly in these environments.",
